diff --git a/changelog/2577.bugfix.rst b/changelog/2577.bugfix.rst
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..4bb56945
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/2577.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Fixed HTTPS proxies to use ``proxy_ssl_context`` (and ``proxy_assert_hostname`` /
+``proxy_assert_fingerprint``) instead of the origin's ``ssl_context`` when connecting
+to the proxy in forwarding mode. ``ProxyManager`` now raises a ``ValueError`` when
+``ssl_context`` is given together with ``use_forwarding_for_https=True``.
